# TG-04 stage A: the window `tg` with its sample backend, under HVF, through Zoraya's
# GUI test runner (make test-tg-window, at scale 1 and at scale 2). The sample's data is
# synthetic, so tg says on the serial line what it shows, and the script reads that; the
# pixels it checks are the tokens' colours. Coordinates are logical: the dock's tiles at
# y 722 (term 352, files 402, edit 452, settings 502, tg 552: five tiles, no room
# chips); tg is the second window, its body at (105, 138), 840 x 520: the list's rows at
# y = 186 + 62 n, the chat from x 406, the composer at the bottom.
# Colours: bg.selection dfe4ec (dark 3a4152), bg.window f7f7f8 (dark 26282d).
serial init: gui: gpu on its own page
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen ~> _
#
# From the dock; the compositor draws its frame. Focused by a click on its title bar.
click 552 722
serial tg: login phone
serial tg: size 840 520
pause 1500
click 500 119
pause 500
shot tg-login
# The login: a number the sample refuses, then phone, code and password (drawn as dots).
type abc\r
then tg: login refused: PHONE_NUMBER_INVALID
type 0000\r
then tg: login code
type 12345\r
then tg: login password
type zoraya
pause 500
shot tg-password
type \r
then tg: ready
serial tg: chats 28 from 0: "Zoraya — розробка" "Saved Messages"
#
# The sample's timer: a message four seconds after the login raises a chat's unread
# count (2 to 3) and moves it up, to the third row.
serial tg: chat "Оксана Коваль" unread 3: Нагадую: зустріч о 15:30, кімната 4.
pause 500
shot tg-list
#
# The list scrolls with the wheel (three rows a notch) and with the keys.
wheel 250 400 down 1
then tg: chats 28 from 3:
wheel 250 400 up 1
then tg: chats 28 from 0:
key end
then tg: chats 28 from 21:
key home
then tg: chats 28 from 0:
#
# A press opens the third row's chat: its messages, with Cyrillic; the row is marked
# (bg.selection at its right end, light), and something is drawn in the messages.
click 255 341
then tg: opened "Оксана Коваль": 14 messages, last: Нагадую: зустріч о 15:30, кімната 4.
then tg: chat "Оксана Коваль" unread 0: Нагадую: зустріч о 15:30, кімната 4.
region 385 312 14 3 dfe4ec
ink 420 200 500 380 f7f7f8 3000
pause 500
shot tg-chat
#
# A typed message is in the view and in the list's last line; then it is confirmed.
type hello from Zoraya\r
then tg: message "Оксана Коваль" out: hello from Zoraya
then tg: chat "Оксана Коваль" unread 0: hello from Zoraya
then tg: delivered: hello from Zoraya
# Cyrillic from the keyboard: System+Space goes to the next layout (us, ua, ru:
# tg-window.root/config/settings), and a Ukrainian and a Russian message are typed, each
# with its own letters (ї, і, ґ; ъ, ё, э); each is in the view and in the list's last line.
chord meta spc
layout ua
type Привіт це їжак і ґанок
key ret
then tg: message "Оксана Коваль" out: Привіт це їжак і ґанок
then tg: chat "Оксана Коваль" unread 0: Привіт це їжак і ґанок
chord meta spc
layout ru
type Привет это съёмка и эхо
key ret
then tg: message "Оксана Коваль" out: Привет это съёмка и эхо
then tg: chat "Оксана Коваль" unread 0: Привет это съёмка и эхо
pause 500
shot tg-cyrillic
chord meta spc
layout us
# The timer's later messages: one to a chat that is not open (its count rises), one to
# the open chat (it shows in the view).
serial tg: chat "Иван Соколов" unread 1: Отчёт отправил, посмотри, когда будет время.
serial tg: message "Оксана Коваль": І візьми, будь ласка, зарядку.
pause 500
shot tg-sent
#
# Search filters the list; Escape clears it.
click 200 162
pause 300
type book
then tg: search "book"
then tg: chats 1 from 0: "Book club"
pause 300
shot tg-search
key esc
then tg: chats 28 from 0:
#
# A long chat: the wheel over the messages scrolls them and brings older pages in; the
# paint times are said every fifty frames.
click 255 217
then tg: opened "Zoraya — розробка":
wheel 700 350 up 30
then tg: older 40, 80 loaded, more
wheel 700 350 down 30
wheel 700 350 up 30
wheel 700 350 down 30
serial tg: paint 50 frames: mean
pause 500
shot tg-group
#
# The summary's card, from the keyboard: Tab from the composer to Send, to the card...
# the Summary button is one Shift+Tab before the composer.
chord shift tab
key ret
then tg: summary unread running:
serial tg: summary unread done:
pause 300
shot tg-summary
key esc
#
# The window resizes: its right edge dragged 120 to the left.
drag 943 400 823 400
then tg: size 7
pause 500
shot tg-resized
#
# Settings: the backend's switches; Escape goes back.
click 370 162
then tg: settings
pause 300
shot tg-settings
key spc
then tg: setting ai.enabled off
key spc
then tg: setting ai.enabled on
key esc
#
# Dark: Zoraya's settings window (the third window, 32 further right and down) turns
# the theme, and tg follows at once: its list's ground is the dark bg.view (1c1e22).
click 502 722
pause 1500
click 217 267
serial settings: Saved and applied.
region 107 300 4 40 1c1e22
# tg in front again (a press on its title bar, right of the settings window).
click 780 119
pause 800
shot tg-dark
